      "full_message": "*🏥 ApexCare Multispeciality Hospital – Medical Prescription*\n\nDear *Rohan Sharma*,\n\nYour doctor consultation has been completed successfully.\n\n*Patient Details:*\n• Patient ID: *PAT-2026-3042*\n• Doctor Name: *Dr. Julian Sterling*\n• Diagnosis: *Acute Viral Pharyngitis with Pyrexia*\n\n*💊 Prescribed Medicines:*\n• *Amoxicillin + Clavulanic Acid 625mg* - 1 Tablet\n  Frequency: Twice daily (1-0-1) | Duration: 5 Days\n  Instructions: After Food\n\n• *Paracetamol 650mg (Dolo 650)* - 1 Tablet\n  Frequency: Thrice daily as needed | Duration: 3 Days\n  Instructions: After Food\n\n• *Levocetirizine 5mg* - 1 Tablet\n  Frequency: Once daily (0-0-1) | Duration: 5 Days\n  Instructions: After Food\n\n*📝 Doctor's Instructions:*\nMaintain oral hydration, complete prescribed antibiotic course, rest for 3 days.\n\n*📅 Next Appointment:*\n• Date: *2026-11-21* at *10:30 AM*\n• Follow-up: Return to clinic if temperature exceeds 102 F or difficulty swallowing occurs.\n\n📄 *Download / View Official Prescription PDF:*\nhttp://localhost:5173/prescription/4\n\nYour digital prescription is also securely stored in your Patient Portal.\n\nThank you for choosing ApexCare Multispeciality Hospital.\nEmergency Helpline: 1800-273-9227",
