      "full_message": "*🏥 ApexCare Multispeciality Hospital – Medical Prescription*\n\nDear *Emily Watson*,\n\nYour doctor consultation has been completed successfully.\n\n*Patient Details:*\n• Patient ID: *PAT-2026-5290*\n• Doctor Name: *Dr. Julian Sterling*\n• Diagnosis: *Acute Bronchial Spasm with Viral Pyrexia*\n\n*💊 Prescribed Medicines:*\n• *Azithromycin 500mg* - 1 tablet\n  Frequency: Once daily | Duration: 3 days\n  Instructions: After Food\n\n• *Levocetirizine 5mg + Montelukast 10mg* - 1 tablet\n  Frequency: Once at night | Duration: 5 days\n  Instructions: After Food\n\n• *Paracetamol 650mg* - 1 tablet\n  Frequency: SOS (as needed, max 3 times/day) | Duration: 3 days\n  Instructions: After Food\n\n*📝 Doctor's Instructions:*\nDrink plenty of warm water. Steam inhalation twice daily. Strict bed rest for 48 hours. Avoid cold food.\n\n*📅 Next Appointment:*\n• Date: *2026-11-21* at *10:30 AM*\n• Follow-up: Return immediately if breathless or chest pain occurs.\n\n📄 *Download / View Official Prescription PDF:*\nhttp://localhost:5173/prescription/3\n\nYour digital prescription is also securely stored in your Patient Portal.\n\nThank you for choosing ApexCare Multispeciality Hospital.\nEmergency Helpline: 1800-273-9227",
