      "full_message": "*🏥 ApexCare Multispeciality Hospital – Medical Prescription*\n\nDear *Vikas Kadam*,\n\nYour doctor consultation has been completed successfully.\n\n*Patient Details:*\n• Patient ID: *PAT-2026-4698*\n• Doctor Name: *Dr. Julian Sterling*\n• Diagnosis: *Acute Upper Respiratory Tract Infection (URTI)*\n\n*💊 Prescribed Medicines:*\n• *Amoxicillin & Clavulanate (Augmentin 625)* - 625 mg\n  Frequency: Twice daily (1-0-1) | Duration: 5 Days\n  Instructions: After Food (Notes: Complete full course)\n\n• *Paracetamol (Dolo 650)* - 650 mg\n  Frequency: As needed (SOS) | Duration: 3 Days\n  Instructions: After Food (Notes: For fever above 100F)\n\n• *Cetirizine 10mg* - 10 mg\n  Frequency: Once daily at bedtime (0-0-1) | Duration: 5 Days\n  Instructions: After Food (Notes: May cause drowsiness)\n\n*📝 Doctor's Instructions:*\nGargle with warm saline water twice daily. Hydrate with warm fluids. Rest for 2 days.\n\n*📅 Next Appointment:*\n• Date: *2026-11-20* at *11:00 AM*\n• Follow-up: Review if fever persists past 3 days or cough worsens.\n\n📄 *Download / View Official Prescription PDF:*\nhttp://localhost:5173/prescription/1\n\nYour digital prescription is also securely stored in your Patient Portal.\n\nThank you for choosing ApexCare Multispeciality Hospital.\nEmergency Helpline: 1800-273-9227",
